{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cosy Haven</strong> is a <strong>casual</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong> <strong>decorating</strong> adventure. Every cosy corner is a blank canvas waiting for your personal touch. You decide the look and feel of each space, from sunlit living rooms to secret bunkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a vast array of customization options for every element\u2014from walls and trims to windmill sails\u2014each design becomes a unique reflection of your own taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101920/extras/Timeline+1.gif?t=1745774777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander beneath majestic windmills whose sails you paint in soothing pastels. Breathe life into warm cottages or sleek modern lofts with a few simple clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize walls, trims, curtains and flooring. Extend your creativity outdoors by choosing color palettes for gardens, fountains and rustic barn doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax to a bespoke soundtrack that flows with your design choices. Move at your own pace in a world that celebrates calm creativity and cosy comfort.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101920/extras/2.gif?t=1745774777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step inside <strong>Cosy Haven</strong> and craft a sanctuary that feels like home\u2014one relaxed brushstroke at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>State of the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right now the game has only a modern loft and a bunker. We will add a new scene every other week for free. And more soundtrack of course.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roadmap:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For every single week; we are planning to add more scenes, new materials.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Look mom! I've become a King!","pa