777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101920/e4172e5d0010e44412580269feca228687292cc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745774777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cosy Haven</strong> is a <strong>casual</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong> <strong>decorating</strong> adventure. Every cosy corner is a blank canvas waiting for your personal touch. You decide the look and feel of each space, from sunlit living rooms to secret bunkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a vast array of customization options for every element\u2014from walls and trims to windmill sails\u2014each design becomes a unique reflection of your own taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101920/extras/Timeline+1.gif?t=1745774777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander beneath majestic windmills whose sails you paint in soothing pastels. Breathe life into warm cottages or sleek modern lofts with a few simple clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize walls, trims, curtains and flooring. Extend your creativity outdoors by choosing color palettes for gardens, fountains and rustic barn doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax to a bespoke soundtrack that flows with your design choices. Move at your own pace in a world that celebrates calm creativity and cosy comfort.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101920/extras/2.gif?t=1745774777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step inside <strong>Cosy Haven</strong> and craft a sanctuary that feels like home\u2014one relaxed brushstroke at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>State of the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right now the game has only a modern loft and a bunker. We will add a new scene every other week for free. And more soundtrack of course.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roadmap:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For every single week; we are planning to add more scenes, new materials.</p>","developers":["Good Punk Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101920/3c9b6e104f95abf3d4531b0a599911c7c6e7d176/header.jpg?t=1745774777","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Cosy Haven: Design Your Homes","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Cosy Haven - $4.99 USD","packageid":1101794,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499}],"title":"Buy Cosy Haven: Design Your Homes"}],"packages":[1101794],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX 6300 - Intel I5 3470 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 6800 - Nvidia RTX 3060 or Better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong